# Security headers for ND Electronic Technologies Ltd.
#
# This file's syntax is understood natively by Netlify and Cloudflare Pages —
# drop the repo onto either one and these apply automatically, no extra
# config needed. On a different host (plain Apache/Nginx/shared hosting),
# these same headers need to be set at the server config level instead —
# see SETUP.md.
#
# Left deliberately without a strict Content-Security-Policy: this site
# loads Google Fonts, Google Maps, the Supabase JS SDK, and Clerk (customer
# auth) from several third-party origins, and a wrong CSP would silently
# break login/checkout rather than fail loudly. Add one once every external
# script/style source in use is enumerated and tested. (Flutterwave was
# removed from checkout — online payment is Cash-on-Delivery only for now.)

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(self), camera=(), microphone=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
